        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 7FBZ, 7 Inch Flush Bolt with Flip Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana 7\" Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a flip style lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws, and strike plate.. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-7FBZ.gif?v=1704354641\" width=\"600\" height=\"277\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 7FBZ 7 Inch Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Here are some other size Flush Bolts we carry:</b> \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-4fbs\">4\" Square Corners</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Square Corners</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-round-corners-deltana-del-6fbr\">6\" Round Corners</a> - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">7\" Heavy Duty</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7\" flush bolt is builder's grade cast zinc. For heavy duty applications please use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">Heavy Duty 7\" Flush Bolt</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 7FBZ Flush Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corner: Round</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7FBZ.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 7FBZ Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "7 Inch Flush Bolt Flip Lever Type",
                "description": "Deltana 7FBZ 7 Inch Flush Bolt - This Deltana 7 Inch Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a flip style lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws, and strike plate. Available in 5 different finishes. ",
